{"strongs": "H5838", "word": "עֲזַרְיָ֫הוּ", "translit": "a.zar.yah", "root": "עזריהו", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Azariah", "definition": "עֲזַרְיָ֫הוּ , עֲזַרְיָה proper name, masculine ( ׳ י hath helped ); Azariah (Old Hebrew עזריהו , Phoenician עזרבעל , Old Aramaic הדדעזר , הדעדר Lzb 338. 258 Cook 42 ); — Αζαριας : 1. king of Judah (Assyrian Azriyâ'û COT 2Kgs 15:1 Jäger BAS i, 468 ) עֲזַרְיָהוּ 2Kgs 15:6 ; 2Kgs 15:8 עֲזַרְיָה 2Kgs 14:21 ; 2Kgs 15:1 ; 2Kgs 15:7 ; 2Kgs 15:17 ; 2Kgs 15:23 ; 2Kgs 15:27 ; 1Chr 3:12 (see עֻזִּיָּה ). 2. יָהוּ - officer of Solomon 1Kgs 4:5 . 3. id. prophet 2Chr 15:1 . 4. sons of Jehosh.: \\ \\ a. id,. 2Chr 21:2 . \\ \\ b. יָה - v 2Chr 21:2 . 5. priests: \\ \\ a. יָהוּ - 1Kgs 4:2 = יָה - 1Chr 5:36 ; 1Chr 5:37 ; Ezra 7:3 . \\ \\ b. יָה - 1Chr 5:35 (twice in verse). \\ \\ c. id. , 1Chr 5:39 ; 1Chr 5:40 ; 1Chr 9:11 ; Ezra 7:1 . \\ \\ d. id. , Neh 10:3 . \\ \\ e. יָהוּ - 2Chr 31:10 ; 2Chr 31:13 , = יָה - 2Chr 26:17 ; 2Chr 26:20 . 6. Levites, ׃י־ָהוּ \\ \\ a. 2Chr 29:12 . \\ \\ b. v 2Chr 29:12 . ׃י־ָה \\ \\ c. 1Chr 6:21 . \\ \\ d. Neh 8:7 . 7. יָהוּ - a temple captain 2Chr 23:1 a ( van d. H. יָה - compare Ginsb margin ), v 2Chr 23:1 b. 8. יָה - wall-builder Neh 3:23 ; Neh 3:24 . 9. יָה - one with Zerubbabel Neh 7:7 ( שְׂרָיָה || Ezra 2:2 ). 10. יָה - Ezra 12:33 . 11. יָהוּ - Epharimite 2Chr 28:12 . 12. יָה - name in Judah: \\ \\ a. son of Ethan (!) 1Chr 2:8 . \\ \\ b. v 1Chr 2:38 v 1Chr 2:39 . — For עֲזַרְיָהוּ 2Chr 22:6 read אֲחַזְיָה compare v 2Chr 22:7 . ** עֲזַרְיָה occurs also Jer 43:2 = (וִ)יזַנְיָה Jer 42:1 (see above); and as friend of Danial Dan 1:6 ; Dan 1:7 ; Dan 1:11 ; Dan 1:19 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5978')\">BDB5978</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5838')\">H5838</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5977')\">BDB5977</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5979')\">BDB5979</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֲזַרְיָ֫הוּ</bdbheb>, <